    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53007" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καμπ-τήρ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῆρος</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bend, angle</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				7.1.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				14.2.14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>turning-point in the</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίαυλος</span>, which was <i>the
			goal</i> in the single race (cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καμπή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			), <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1409a32
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BCH</u>
				23.567
			</span></i>(Delph., <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Babr.
				29.4
			</span></i>: pl., as works of art, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				36.25
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. βίου</span>
