				Herod.
				10.3
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. πύματος</span>, of the
			colophon which marks the last page, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				12.257.1
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Mel.
			</span></i>).</div>
